infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Full page load vs SPA route change
  desc Three a11y jobs the browser does for free — the same three a SPA must do by hand
  compares
    - label Full page load — the browser does it
      children
        - label Focus reset to the new document
          desc Sequential reading restarts from a known top
        - label Document title announced
          desc The screen reader names the new page
        - label Reading order from a known start
          desc Next Tab continues from the top of new content
    - label SPA route change — you do it
      children
        - label Focus stranded on stale DOM or body
          desc It stays wherever the DOM diff left it
        - label Nothing announced — no nav event for AT
          desc A DOM diff is not a navigation
        - label Next Tab starts from nowhere
          desc Fix: focus the new h1 with tabIndex -1
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
